                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.05163/2611.05163v1/assets/method.jpg",
                "caption": "Figure 1:RoboTryOn pipeline.(a) The image model sequentially translates keyframes\nof a human video into robot keyframes, the video\nmodel synthesizes the motion between them under the guidance of the\nhand skeleton flow, and the inverse dynamics model labels the actions. (b) The image model inpaints the masked human frame, using the\nprevious robot keyframe as a reference. (c) The video model synthesizes\nthe robot video, conditioned on the robot keyframes at their temporal\npositions and the skeleton flow.",
                "position": 361
            }
        ]
    },
