                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.05163/2611.05163v1/failures.png",
                "caption": "Figure 15:Failure cases.The red box in each row marks the\nregion enlarged on the right.Generation failures(top):\nsynthesized videos in which the generative models do not preserve the\nobjects. OnPnP Ball in Cupthe transparent cup suddenly\ndisappears from the hand as it is lifted, leaving the ball on the\ntable. OnAir Fryerthe fingers pass through the handle instead\nof closing around it (dashed circle).IDM errors(bottom): policy\nrollouts that fail because the action labels of the synthesized\nepisodes place the hand imprecisely. OnPnP Coffee Potthe hand\nreaches the handle but closes below it, and onPnP Bottle to\nShelfit closes low on the bottle and pushes it against the shelf\ninstead of lifting it onto it.",
